            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode tanda <code>=</code> untuk memberikan nilai string <code>\"Enterprise\"</code> kepada konstanta <code>spaceship</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spaceship = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Enterprise&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
